1
00:00:00,057 --> 00:00:02,647
(Penny:)Oh, my gosh. I can't believe it.
Really?

2
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:04,690
(Penny:)Oh, I'm so excited. Thank you.

3
00:00:04,854 --> 00:00:07,564
(Penny:)Thank you so much. Okay, bye.

4
00:00:07,732 --> 00:00:10,732
I got the hemorrhoid commercial.
I start Monday.

5
00:00:12,069 --> 00:00:13,609
(Sheldon:)What about Nebraska?

6
00:00:13,779 --> 00:00:16,819
(Penny:)Oh, hell with Nebraska.
I'm gonna be a star.

7
