of teaching physics?

8
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,340
(Actress:)Ready to ride?

9
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:38,010
(Penny(on screen):)I don't think so, Mom.

10
00:00:38,179 --> 00:00:39,679
(Penny(on screen):)Not today.

11
00:00:39,847 --> 00:00:40,977
(Actress:)Oh, sweetie.

12
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:43,310
Hemorrhoids acting up again?

13
00:00:43,476 --> 00:00:45,396
You don't know the haIf of it.

14
00:00:45,561 --> 00:00:47,601
(Actress:)Oh, yes, I do.

15
00:00:47,772 --> 00:00:49,902
(Actress:)Try a dab of this.

16
00:00:51,859 --> 00:00:55,659
"Rose-scented Preparation-H
for women?"

17
00:00:55,821 --> 00:00:59,621
(Actress:)Now, the H is for her.

18
00:01:04,705 --> 00:01:07,375
- I'm proud of you.
- Shh. Here comes my joke.

19
